# The database and everything beside it: six years of readings, the session
# signing key, logs and the pid file. The dashboard is the system of record and
# the NAS holds the live copy - see deploy/DEPLOY.md for how it is backed up.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.key
*.pid
*.log
*.xlsx
deploy/.env
deploy/password.txt

# The two source workbooks, and the .xlsx snapshots the Admin page writes. Kept
# out for the same reason as the database: years of personal readings rather
# than code, and a couple of MB of binary.
#
# To carry a historical source in the repo after all, both the `*.xlsx` line
# above and the relevant line below have to go - the first would otherwise
# still catch it. Nothing else needs changing; the importers read them where
# they sit.
Weigh-in Tracker.xlsx
strava_webscrape/strava_runs.xlsx
strava_webscrape/~$*.xlsx
strava_webscrape/*.csv

__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/

# Machine-local tool settings. .claude/launch.json is shared deliberately.
.claude/settings.local.json

# PyCharm's per-machine project state. Nothing in it describes the project in a
# way another machine would want.
.idea/
